WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.590
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.860 --> 00:02.700
Shoot.

3
00:02.700 --> 00:03.660
Itti.

4
00:03.660 --> 00:05.500
I found something in the footage.

5
00:05.500 --> 00:07.380
That's one of Itti's men.

6
00:07.380 --> 00:10.680
He's the one. The person I think killed Anda.

7
00:10.680 --> 00:14.800
Bring me your girlfriend, and I'll wipe out your debt.

8
00:14.800 --> 00:17.636
I see almost everyone's here. Who's still missing?

9
00:18.880 --> 00:20.080
Jinna, right?

10
00:20.080 --> 00:21.920
Jinna. Go help Podduang.

11
00:21.920 --> 00:23.489
You're no use to me anymore.

12
00:26.360 --> 00:28.543
So, who's next?

13
00:44.120 --> 00:46.640
Hey! Stop resisting.

14
00:46.640 --> 00:51.056
How could you do this, Itti? How are you involved in Anda's death?

15
00:52.480 --> 00:55.480
- You're Anda's brother, for God's sake! - Exactly.

16
00:55.480 --> 00:59.203
He was my own brother. Why did he have to meddle in this?

17
01:00.620 --> 01:02.216
What did he do?

18
01:04.000 --> 01:06.300
What did he do?

19
01:06.300 --> 01:10.176
If you want to know, why don't you ask your new friend?

20
01:12.960 --> 01:16.280
I told your brother everything so that he would be careful.

21
01:16.280 --> 01:17.960
I didn't tell him so you'd kill him.

22
01:17.960 --> 01:19.920
- You bastard! - Shut up!

23
01:19.920 --> 01:21.969
Do you want to join your boyfriend in the grave?

24
01:41.580 --> 01:45.120
[Characters, places, and incidents in this production]

25
01:45.120 --> 01:47.488
[are entirely fictitious.]

26
01:47.488 --> 01:50.460
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

27
03:29.720 --> 03:33.200
Podduang, I'm sorry for bringing you into this mess.

28
03:33.200 --> 03:35.110
Don't blame yourself, Amp.

29
03:36.640 --> 03:40.288
It's Itti's fault for killing Anda.

30
03:40.288 --> 03:41.756
Smart, aren't you?

31
03:47.000 --> 03:51.903
What do you want? Just say it! Do you want money?

32
03:54.380 --> 03:58.743
Would I ask a pathetic kid like you for money?

33
04:01.040 --> 04:04.530
This woman here has what I want.

34
04:05.168 --> 04:07.480
Everything you've got on me.

35
04:07.480 --> 04:09.720
- I want it all. - I've already deleted it all!

36
04:09.720 --> 04:12.883
- I deleted it after sending it to Anda. - I don't believe you!

37
04:15.880 --> 04:19.600
Why would I want to keep your dirty little secrets?

38
04:19.600 --> 04:23.280
- I'm asking you nicely, Amp. - She said she deleted it all!

39
04:23.280 --> 04:27.000
Shut up. You think I'm joking?

40
04:27.000 --> 04:31.280
Do you see this gun? It's loaded with real bullets.

41
04:31.280 --> 04:35.756
And Anda's death really was my doing.

42
04:36.480 --> 04:39.680
- How did you kill Anda? - Why do you want to know?

43
04:39.680 --> 04:41.816
Want to end up like him?

44
04:43.080 --> 04:46.040
No, that's too much of a hassle.

45
04:46.040 --> 04:49.843
Someone like you, one shot is all it takes to send you to heaven.

46
04:51.400 --> 04:55.483
Since you're going to kill me anyway, tell me how you killed Anda.

47
04:57.560 --> 04:58.790
Fine.

48
05:01.120 --> 05:06.763
If you want to know so badly, I'll tell you so you can die in peace.

49
05:18.860 --> 05:21.260
Let us go right now!

50
05:21.260 --> 05:23.340
- Let me go! - Let me out!

51
05:23.340 --> 05:25.923
Release us now!

52
05:30.840 --> 05:34.220
- Where'd you get these videos? - How could you do this, Itti?

53
05:34.220 --> 05:37.440
You're supposed to be a cop. This is human trafficking.

54
05:37.440 --> 05:41.590
- Are you so greedy you'd stoop this low? - Where'd you get these videos?

55
05:42.340 --> 05:47.060
Doesn't matter where I got them. What would Dad say if he found out?

56
05:47.060 --> 05:49.583
You'd better be ready to explain.

57
05:51.360 --> 05:56.020
He chose to meddle and get in my way,

58
05:56.020 --> 05:57.623
so I had to deal with him.

59
05:59.380 --> 06:03.740
Every car key can be reprogrammed.

60
06:03.740 --> 06:07.103
It can even be operated remotely.

61
06:11.552 --> 06:13.563
How could you do something like this?

62
06:14.760 --> 06:18.280
You wanted to get rich through such evil means?

63
06:18.280 --> 06:19.443
Yeah.

64
06:20.860 --> 06:23.180
Help!

65
06:23.180 --> 06:25.710
- Let me go! - Help!

66
06:26.720 --> 06:28.280
Let me go!

67
06:28.280 --> 06:30.090
- Let me go! - Let me out!

68
06:31.060 --> 06:32.603
What's gotten into you?

69
06:33.904 --> 06:36.780
Growing a conscience all of a sudden?

70
06:36.780 --> 06:41.280
- I'm so disappointed in you. - You shouldn't have expected anything from me.

71
06:41.280 --> 06:44.230
What about Dad and Mom?

72
06:44.928 --> 06:47.780
How do you think they'd feel?

73
06:47.780 --> 06:50.200
This isn't how Dad raised you to be.

74
06:50.200 --> 06:53.400
This is all your fault.

75
06:53.400 --> 06:58.143
You did this. You're the one who made me this way.

76
06:59.520 --> 07:02.600
- Doesn't Dad love you more? - Love? Don't make me laugh.

77
07:02.600 --> 07:07.030
He just used me to fulfill his own wishes because you refused to obey him!

78
07:07.800 --> 07:10.940
You don't know what I've been through.

79
07:10.940 --> 07:15.060
You get everything you want.

80
07:15.060 --> 07:18.960
Even when you fell for a man, Mom and Dad were barely upset.

81
07:18.960 --> 07:20.880
But they couldn't stop you.

82
07:20.880 --> 07:25.536
Then why didn't you just tell him? You should've just told them no.

83
07:31.600 --> 07:33.643
You think I haven't tried?

84
07:35.480 --> 07:38.930
You and I are not the same, Anda.

85
07:40.900 --> 07:43.196
No matter what I do,

86
07:45.380 --> 07:48.210
Dad only cares about obedience.

87
08:03.632 --> 08:07.640
Hello, Kum. It's nothing.

88
08:07.640 --> 08:09.630
I'm just having dinner with Itti.

89
08:15.560 --> 08:17.920
Anda was receiving treatment for depression.

90
08:17.920 --> 08:21.690
An autopsy wouldn't surprise anyone.

91
08:22.900 --> 08:28.790
Even if they found sedatives in his system, they couldn't trace them back to me.

92
08:48.640 --> 08:51.923
He was just a sleepyhead who liked napping in his car.

93
08:52.560 --> 08:58.403
No one would suspect he was drugged and left to suffocate.

94
09:13.984 --> 09:17.940
Sir. Why are you sleeping in the car?

95
09:17.940 --> 09:21.323
Chok. Handle it.

96
09:27.760 --> 09:30.320
Come here. Hush money.

97
09:30.320 --> 09:34.330
Keep quiet if you don't want trouble.

98
09:38.320 --> 09:40.716
That security guard is already dead.

99
09:46.320 --> 09:48.350
He died for so little money.

100
09:49.840 --> 09:53.703
And now, it's your turn.

101
09:55.440 --> 10:00.144
Itti rigged Anda's car system to keep the doors locked.

102
10:00.144 --> 10:05.480
That app let him lock someone inside and suffocate them.

103
10:05.480 --> 10:09.503
What a monster. That's his own brother.

104
10:13.140 --> 10:17.850
Where is all my data? I'm going to destroy it all.

105
10:24.120 --> 10:29.419
Mr. Jinna, you're the owner's son, but residents can still report you.

106
10:29.419 --> 10:32.680
Mr. Jinna, let's wait for the tenant to return.

107
10:32.680 --> 10:35.040
Help me find something instead.

108
10:35.040 --> 10:37.200
What are you looking for, Mr. Jinna?

109
10:37.200 --> 10:40.040
Anything that stores data.

110
10:40.040 --> 10:43.311
Do you know anything else? Explain everything to me.

111
10:43.311 --> 10:47.680
I only know as much as you do. Jinna just told us to be on standby.

112
10:47.680 --> 10:51.360
He's trying to find out where Itti is.

113
10:51.360 --> 10:54.400
- Why go find Itti? - Wait a minute.

114
10:54.400 --> 10:58.816
That's why we can't reach Podduang?

115
11:00.453 --> 11:02.383
I'm going to count to three.

116
11:03.640 --> 11:07.419
Please, I didn't keep anything.

117
11:07.419 --> 11:09.760
- I really deleted it all. - One.

118
11:09.760 --> 11:11.560
- She said she deleted it! - Two.

119
11:11.560 --> 11:15.430
- You can check my computer or my phone. - I don't believe you!

120
11:19.800 --> 11:24.160
This might be a bit old, but I think it can store data.

121
11:31.400 --> 11:33.360
Where is that flash drive?

122
11:34.440 --> 11:36.963
Otherwise, I'll blow this kid's head off.

123
11:40.120 --> 11:41.383
Quick!

124
11:47.560 --> 11:52.240
I knew you wouldn't believe me if I just told you.

125
11:52.240 --> 11:56.670
So I brought the evidence I just found.

126
12:01.620 --> 12:03.200
If I hadn't seen this evidence,

127
12:03.200 --> 12:08.856
I would never have thought my eldest son, whom I love and am so proud of,

128
12:09.920 --> 12:12.643
could do such terrible things.

129
12:13.280 --> 12:16.636
I think Itti might have abducted Podduang.

130
12:18.360 --> 12:22.210
What do you mean? And what does Podduang have to do with it?

131
12:24.720 --> 12:27.226
Hurry and go help Podduang.

132
12:27.226 --> 12:32.596
Anda told me to hurry up and help Podduang.

133
12:33.220 --> 12:39.220
Do you have any idea where Itti might have taken Podduang?

134
12:42.073 --> 12:46.750
Bet you have no idea whose condo that is.

135
12:49.280 --> 12:51.296
I don't care whose it is.

136
12:52.080 --> 12:57.920
Where did you hide the drive? Otherwise, I'll beat you to death, Amp.

137
12:57.920 --> 13:03.270
I tried tracking the earbuds' signal. Before it disappeared, it was in this area.

138
13:03.270 --> 13:05.506
[Devices - Airpod Anda]

139
13:11.273 --> 13:14.116
Or could it be the building that I gave to Itti?

140
13:35.500 --> 13:36.940
Spill it! Now!

141
13:36.940 --> 13:40.925
[Thamprateep]

142
13:40.925 --> 13:42.623
Just tell him, Amp.

143
13:43.880 --> 13:45.430
It's okay.

144
13:47.920 --> 13:51.600
You only use violence to act tough,

145
13:51.600 --> 13:54.610
but deep down, you're scared shitless.

146
13:55.960 --> 13:59.560
- How pathetic! - You brat!

147
13:59.560 --> 14:03.568
No one would care if you died.

148
14:03.568 --> 14:05.040
Why the hell are you so nosy?

149
14:05.040 --> 14:07.960
Killing more people won't make your life any better.

150
14:07.960 --> 14:09.390
So what?

151
14:11.660 --> 14:15.720
I'm not the one who's going to die tonight.

152
14:15.720 --> 14:17.789
You are.

153
14:18.400 --> 14:20.516
This is what you want, right?

154
14:23.580 --> 14:25.476
- Jinna! - Stay back!

155
14:31.633 --> 14:33.563
Where else did you copy it?

156
14:34.880 --> 14:37.953
- Good question. - Don't be a smartass with me.

157
14:37.953 --> 14:40.716
You know one shot will blow your brains out, right?

158
14:41.399 --> 14:45.760
You don't even know where else I've backed it up.

159
14:45.760 --> 14:50.283
You'll never know who else knows what you've done.

160
14:51.026 --> 14:56.696
You'll have to live in constant fear, hunting down everyone who knows your secret.

161
14:57.266 --> 14:59.396
Whatever I do is my business.

162
15:00.680 --> 15:01.804
Really?

163
15:03.620 --> 15:06.823
Are you really going to hunt down everyone who knows?

164
15:12.496 --> 15:13.710
Dad...

165
15:15.120 --> 15:16.870
What are you doing here?

166
15:18.140 --> 15:23.496
I should be the one asking you that. What are you doing here?

167
15:28.120 --> 15:31.383
Did you really kill your brother, Itti?

168
15:33.533 --> 15:37.680
You did that just because you wanted to be successful?

169
15:37.680 --> 15:38.990
Is that all?

170
15:41.120 --> 15:44.783
You wanted to make me and everyone proud of you,

171
15:45.727 --> 15:48.193
so you had to do that?

172
15:48.193 --> 15:51.800
- If so, why don't you just kill me, too? - Dad...

173
15:51.800 --> 15:53.683
Don't say such things.

174
15:54.520 --> 15:59.770
- Everything I did was for our family. - Even if you had to kill your family?

175
16:00.512 --> 16:01.643
Look.

176
16:02.560 --> 16:05.333
You've lost your mind. You've lost your mind, Itti.

177
16:05.333 --> 16:07.280
I never taught you to be like this.

178
16:07.280 --> 16:10.330
- I never raised you like this! - Wasn't it because of you?

179
16:10.960 --> 16:13.363
You always pressured me to be who you wanted.

180
16:14.660 --> 16:17.680
You let Anda live his own life,

181
16:17.680 --> 16:21.280
but I had to be everything you wanted.

182
16:21.280 --> 16:23.260
This is it, Dad.

183
16:23.260 --> 16:28.216
I'm proving I can be the good son you want.

184
16:30.068 --> 16:31.323
You...

185
16:33.913 --> 16:35.976
Where else did you copy this?

186
16:49.632 --> 16:50.843
Listen.

187
16:51.880 --> 16:54.230
What are you making me listen to now?

188
16:55.713 --> 16:56.943
Just listen.

189
17:18.300 --> 17:20.143
- I don't hear a word-- - Itti.

190
17:29.140 --> 17:32.523
I'm right here. Right next to you.

191
17:35.800 --> 17:39.720
Is this a joke? Where did you get Anda's voice from?

192
17:39.720 --> 17:44.000
I know you wanted to be successful. I know you felt pressured.

193
17:44.000 --> 17:48.469
But did you have to do this to me? I'm your brother.

194
17:49.600 --> 17:51.400
Did you hate me that much?

195
17:51.400 --> 17:53.789
- How could you do it? - Who are you?

196
17:53.789 --> 17:55.270
Enough already!

197
17:55.840 --> 17:59.170
Don't you remember how close we were?

198
18:00.720 --> 18:03.320
You used to sneak me out of school to go to the beach.

199
18:03.320 --> 18:05.200
Don't you remember?

200
18:08.440 --> 18:09.763
Anda...

201
18:10.960 --> 18:12.436
Anda?

202
18:26.360 --> 18:28.196
Is it really you, Anda?

203
18:30.600 --> 18:32.583
I'm sorry for making things hard for you.

204
18:33.920 --> 18:38.496
If I'd asked if you were tired of carrying that burden,

205
18:39.240 --> 18:41.920
or if you needed my help...

206
18:41.920 --> 18:47.216
If we'd just talked sooner, maybe you wouldn't hate me this much.

207
18:49.220 --> 18:50.636
I...

208
18:51.200 --> 18:55.430
You've been so tired, haven't you? All this time.

209
19:16.040 --> 19:18.070
How can I fix this?

210
19:18.813 --> 19:23.593
You can't. Just let everything be as it should be.

211
19:23.593 --> 19:26.083
You can't control everything in this world.

212
19:27.626 --> 19:30.363
But I didn't mean for it to turn out like this.

213
19:31.079 --> 19:36.160
I didn't want this either. Let's end this now, Itti.

214
19:36.160 --> 19:38.543
Spend your life reflecting on this.

215
19:40.360 --> 19:43.782
Mom and Dad are ready to give you a chance.

216
19:43.782 --> 19:46.720
They love you so much, you know.

217
19:46.720 --> 19:49.263
- They really love you so much. - Anda...

218
19:50.453 --> 19:52.203
I'm sorry.

219
19:53.920 --> 19:55.923
I'm sorry, Anda.

220
20:00.760 --> 20:05.150
I didn't mean for this to happen. I'm sorry.

221
20:08.560 --> 20:10.720
I'm sorry.

222
20:10.720 --> 20:12.643
- I'm really sorry. - Itti.

223
20:14.920 --> 20:20.690
Anda, I'm sorry. I didn't mean it. I'm sorry.

224
20:25.940 --> 20:27.376
Anda...

225
20:28.200 --> 20:32.300
I'm sorry. Anda...

226
20:32.300 --> 20:33.990
I'm really sorry.

227
20:42.800 --> 20:44.143
This way, please.

228
20:53.800 --> 20:55.683
Ma'am, please step to the side.

229
20:56.942 --> 21:00.316
Podduang. Are you really skipping the hospital?

230
21:00.966 --> 21:04.400
I'll go in a bit. Let me sort things out first.

231
21:04.400 --> 21:10.016
Yeah, go get yourself checked out. We'll take Anda's dad to the police station.

232
21:19.127 --> 21:22.796
We'll ride with the police to give our statements.

233
21:23.407 --> 21:25.603
Drive safely, okay?

234
21:33.960 --> 21:35.576
Does it hurt?

235
21:37.520 --> 21:38.856
It hurts a little.

236
21:50.040 --> 21:54.036
Promise me, Podduang. Don't ever do this again.

237
21:57.929 --> 21:59.056
Okay.

238
22:01.640 --> 22:03.610
Don't ever disappear like that again.

239
22:22.480 --> 22:23.920
- Can we interview you? - Please, sir?

240
22:23.920 --> 22:25.560
- Answer us. - Do you regret it?

241
22:25.560 --> 22:28.360
- Did you really murder your brother? - Make way, please.

242
22:28.360 --> 22:30.120
Do you think you'll get away with it?

243
22:30.120 --> 22:33.880
- Will you get away with it, sir? - Why did you have to go that far?

244
22:33.880 --> 22:36.060
- Please answer. - Make way, please.

245
22:36.060 --> 22:38.960
- Answer the questions, please! - Out of the way, please!

246
22:38.960 --> 22:41.720
- Why did you do this? - Answer the questions, please!

247
22:41.720 --> 22:43.320
- Excuse me. - Move aside, please.

248
22:43.320 --> 22:44.580
What did your family say?

249
22:44.580 --> 22:47.060
- Mr. Itti, answer our questions. - Please answer!

250
22:47.060 --> 22:50.700
- Why did you kill him? - What did he do to you?

251
22:53.420 --> 22:55.200
- Okay. - Answer the questions, please!

252
22:55.200 --> 22:56.260
Make way, please.

253
22:56.260 --> 22:57.220
- Answer us. - Sir!

254
22:57.220 --> 22:59.640
- Out of the way, please! - That's enough.

255
22:59.640 --> 23:03.466
You look so stressed, don't you realize? You'll get wrinkles early.

256
23:03.466 --> 23:06.716
Just look at the news. How could I not be stressed?

257
23:12.520 --> 23:16.600
I dreamed about Anda last night. Just like the night before.

258
23:18.960 --> 23:21.570
Anda probably wanted to thank us.

259
23:22.286 --> 23:25.376
I hope Anda's spirit won't have to suffer anymore.

260
23:39.200 --> 23:41.296
Will Anda be okay?

261
23:43.480 --> 23:46.223
Is he still holding on to something?

262
23:46.999 --> 23:48.416
I don't know.

263
23:49.440 --> 23:52.603
But hearing no more voices from the earbuds could mean...

264
23:54.693 --> 23:56.750
he's in a better place now.

265
24:07.800 --> 24:10.210
We've done all we could, Jinna.

266
24:13.481 --> 24:16.243
You were the best friend Anda could ask for.

267
24:17.072 --> 24:19.450
I'm sure he can feel it.

268
24:21.160 --> 24:23.336
You and all our friends...

269
24:24.179 --> 24:26.223
gave it your all for Anda.

270
24:56.999 --> 25:02.999
Hello. I'm Jinna, Anda's friend.

271
25:04.587 --> 25:09.376
Anda and I were very close.

272
25:10.766 --> 25:12.709
But I know that...

273
25:13.653 --> 25:18.610
it wasn't as long as his family's, who'd been with him since birth.

274
25:28.259 --> 25:33.576
The ones who shaped him into who he was, into our beloved Anda.

275
25:38.673 --> 25:41.289
We all know that...

276
25:41.289 --> 25:45.200
he was lovely and kind-hearted.

277
25:45.200 --> 25:49.516
- Andaman! Andaman! - Andaman! Andaman!

278
25:52.993 --> 25:57.320
He was someone who always had a smile for everyone.

279
25:57.320 --> 26:00.740
- Please look forward to it. - Andaman!

280
26:00.740 --> 26:02.556
- Andaman! - Andaman!

281
26:05.960 --> 26:08.830
He's someone we've always loved.

282
26:09.680 --> 26:14.819
- Four diodes form a diamond in a bridge... - Yes.

283
26:14.819 --> 26:17.840
It's a closed electrical circuit.

284
26:17.840 --> 26:21.023
No matter what happened in his life,

285
26:22.086 --> 26:26.630
none of us wanted him to be in pain, even for a moment.

286
26:31.200 --> 26:35.360
How do you guys think we will be when we grow up?

287
26:35.360 --> 26:39.810
You're talking like we're so young right now.

288
26:41.080 --> 26:45.053
We're still young by human standards.

289
26:45.053 --> 26:47.623
We've only lived a quarter of our lives.

290
26:49.120 --> 26:53.636
Who knows how long we'll live?

291
26:54.760 --> 26:58.013
- Maybe we've already lived half our lives. - Hey.

292
26:58.013 --> 27:02.080
Why do you always assume the worst? Let me tell you something.

293
27:02.080 --> 27:04.706
A good person like you will live a long time.

294
27:04.706 --> 27:08.136
Hey, but I'm not staying until I'm old. I can't be bothered.

295
27:09.240 --> 27:12.830
I don't know how much time we have left.

296
27:13.653 --> 27:15.743
But as long as I'm alive,

297
27:16.333 --> 27:19.263
I want to make every second count...

298
27:20.280 --> 27:24.710
with the people I love, and do what I want to do.

299
27:25.720 --> 27:27.590
Look at that sunset.

300
27:28.560 --> 27:32.116
It's so beautiful. I don't know if we'll see it in our lifetimes.

301
27:33.573 --> 27:36.939
And I hope I'll be with you guys for a long time.

302
27:36.939 --> 27:38.596
Don't you dare leave me.

303
27:39.326 --> 27:41.703
- Come on. - Who would ever leave you, man?

304
27:43.280 --> 27:45.633
Hey, guys.

305
27:45.633 --> 27:49.513
- Friends forever. - Friends forever.

306
27:53.680 --> 27:56.236
We all saw him as a wonderful friend.

307
27:57.220 --> 27:59.630
We shared many good times together.

308
28:01.326 --> 28:03.090
I could feel that...

309
28:03.700 --> 28:05.976
Anda was very happy.

310
28:07.360 --> 28:09.590
His friends surrounded him...

311
28:11.500 --> 28:13.770
with love and well-wishes.

312
28:16.020 --> 28:18.276
I hoped he'd meet someone good...

313
28:20.146 --> 28:22.063
who would love him with all their heart.

314
28:22.727 --> 28:26.816
And Anda was so incredibly lucky to have found that person...

315
28:27.993 --> 28:30.670
while he was still alive.

316
28:32.203 --> 28:37.396
Even though it wasn't for very long, I believe...

317
28:38.506 --> 28:41.236
that relationship was truly precious to him.

318
28:45.760 --> 28:47.843
He met a man who loved him...

319
28:49.706 --> 28:52.523
and wished him well unconditionally.

320
28:54.739 --> 28:56.110
Anda...

321
28:58.906 --> 29:02.256
I don't know where you are right now.

322
29:03.472 --> 29:07.896
But all of us hope that you're doing well.

323
29:10.939 --> 29:13.570
You don't have to suffer anymore.

324
29:16.147 --> 29:18.810
This world never deserved a good person like you.

325
29:20.180 --> 29:25.650
I love you so much, Anda. We all truly love you.

326
29:27.099 --> 29:31.956
I still stand by my word. I will never leave you.

327
29:33.255 --> 29:37.763
You will always be in my heart, and in all of our friends' hearts, too.

328
29:40.139 --> 29:43.890
I'm always with you, Anda.

329
30:54.586 --> 30:58.040
I know it's hard to believe.

330
30:58.040 --> 31:02.000
But I figured this out by listening to the sounds in these earbuds.

331
31:02.000 --> 31:05.513
If I have to give a statement, this is exactly what I'd say.

332
31:05.513 --> 31:09.800
I want to believe you. But isn't it a bit far-fetched?

333
31:09.800 --> 31:15.800
You're saying your late friend spoke to you through earbuds?

334
31:19.813 --> 31:22.196
How am I supposed to write a report about this?

335
31:23.200 --> 31:28.880
I know it's difficult. How about I help you after the cremation?

336
31:28.880 --> 31:32.250
I can word it for official documents.

337
31:33.440 --> 31:35.760
Okay. All right.

338
31:35.760 --> 31:39.000
- You've done a great job. - Thank you.

339
31:39.000 --> 31:42.506
But if I may give some advice, don't ever do what you did again.

340
31:42.506 --> 31:44.900
Okay? It's dangerous.

341
31:44.900 --> 31:48.603
I wouldn't do anything like this again.

342
31:51.480 --> 31:55.036
- My condolences once again. - Thank you.

343
32:17.700 --> 32:19.280
Wake up.

344
32:19.280 --> 32:20.920
- Art. - What?

345
32:20.920 --> 32:22.376
Anda came to me in a dream.

346
32:22.376 --> 32:24.980
- And? - He said I'm going to win the lottery.

347
32:24.980 --> 32:29.960
- No way! Are you for real? - Not kidding, man. It's real.

348
32:29.960 --> 32:34.040
- What are we eating tonight? - Let's go for some raw beef salad, buddy.

349
32:34.040 --> 32:35.680
- And spicy raw beef, too. - You got it.

350
32:35.680 --> 32:38.403
Let's do it!

351
32:52.506 --> 32:54.976
Why did you let yourself go like this?

352
32:55.966 --> 32:57.976
I don't think you're sad.

353
32:58.859 --> 33:01.176
I think you're just being lazy.

354
33:04.000 --> 33:08.283
What about Jinna? Why did he disappear after the funeral?

355
33:08.960 --> 33:13.200
Don't tell me that you've been dumped already.

356
33:13.200 --> 33:16.646
Satang, stop annoying me. I'm trying to watch a movie.

357
33:16.646 --> 33:21.120
Did that strike a nerve? Did you really get dumped?

358
33:21.120 --> 33:22.916
Just get lost already!

359
33:23.580 --> 33:27.787
Well, it makes sense. He's the son of a billionaire.

360
33:27.787 --> 33:30.880
Why would he date a dim-witted college kid like you?

361
33:30.880 --> 33:34.940
- I told you to get lost! - Yeah, I'm leaving now.

362
33:34.940 --> 33:37.650
Watching soccer with friends. I won't be home tonight.

363
33:49.500 --> 33:51.560
[Podduang: How are you?]

364
33:51.560 --> 33:53.588
[Jinna: Still at the event with my dad.]

365
33:53.588 --> 33:55.615
[Podduang: I've already finished some movies.]

366
33:55.615 --> 33:57.596
[It's so boring. Satang isn't home, either.]

367
34:14.580 --> 34:17.960
- Say hello to Lady Pat, son. - Hello.

368
34:17.960 --> 34:21.466
Jinna. You've grown up so much.

369
34:21.466 --> 34:25.760
You rarely attend events with your dad. I've been wanting to see you.

370
34:25.760 --> 34:30.840
He's a bit shy. But we've agreed he'll take over my business.

371
34:30.840 --> 34:33.720
So I have to introduce him around, or people might forget him.

372
34:33.720 --> 34:37.263
Oh, how could anyone forget him? He's so handsome.

373
34:37.263 --> 34:40.929
Do you have a girlfriend? Want me to introduce you to someone?

374
34:43.340 --> 34:45.570
What kind of girls do you like?

375
34:46.986 --> 34:48.480
Let's leave that for later.

376
34:48.480 --> 34:51.323
- I want to teach him the ropes first. - That's right.

377
34:51.323 --> 34:55.980
How can you say that, Mr. Chanin? He should be doing both.

378
34:55.980 --> 34:58.696
He's still a fine young man, isn't he?

379
35:14.080 --> 35:16.760
Amp.

380
35:16.760 --> 35:18.200
I knew you weren't asleep yet.

381
35:18.200 --> 35:21.440
I bought some apples for you. Here, plenty of them.

382
35:26.240 --> 35:28.613
You brought so many.

383
35:28.613 --> 35:32.903
- How am I going to eat all these alone? - Well, eat them with Jinna then.

384
35:37.040 --> 35:40.256
Why are you making that face? Did you two have a fight?

385
35:43.039 --> 35:46.790
If there's something wrong, just talk it out and settle it, okay?

386
35:48.539 --> 35:49.909
I'll go now.

387
36:28.000 --> 36:29.570
Have you been drinking?

388
36:30.667 --> 36:32.876
Everyone kept trying to get me to drink.

389
36:34.106 --> 36:36.030
I missed you like crazy.

390
36:38.819 --> 36:41.070
And you look so handsome.

391
36:43.520 --> 36:45.156
I can be even more handsome.

392
36:53.800 --> 36:55.770
Satang is away tonight, right?

393
36:59.060 --> 37:00.350
Yeah.

394
40:41.424 --> 40:42.583
Jinna.

395
40:43.180 --> 40:44.283
Yes, baby?

396
40:45.200 --> 40:46.890
How much do you love me?

397
40:48.512 --> 40:50.036
Why are you asking?

398
40:53.160 --> 40:54.783
Do you love me?

399
40:55.673 --> 40:59.038
I can't reveal that I'm a billionaire's son like you.

400
40:59.038 --> 41:02.036
Are you crazy? What are you thinking?

401
41:03.046 --> 41:04.330
I...

402
41:05.286 --> 41:09.436
I'm just a dim-witted college kid, like Satang said.

403
41:10.607 --> 41:12.310
Will you get bored of me?

404
41:13.173 --> 41:14.956
You're filthy rich,

405
41:16.113 --> 41:17.983
while I have nothing.

406
41:20.400 --> 41:22.276
Why would you need to be rich?

407
41:23.620 --> 41:27.359
I'll take care of you for life. It's no big deal.

408
41:27.359 --> 41:28.663
I don't know.

409
41:30.053 --> 41:31.703
Just don't ever get bored of me.

410
41:32.959 --> 41:34.950
I love you so much, Jinna.

411
41:42.393 --> 41:46.843
I won't. I love you so much, too.

412
41:48.487 --> 41:50.270
Don't overthink it.

413
41:55.193 --> 41:57.023
I'll be right here,

414
41:58.280 --> 42:02.680
loving you more and more, every single day.

415
42:02.680 --> 42:07.680
I love you before I go to sleep, and I love you when I wake up.

416
42:07.680 --> 42:12.567
I'll never stop loving you. Even if you get bored, I won't care.

417
42:12.567 --> 42:14.036
Understand?

418
42:17.787 --> 42:19.876
I love you this much already.

419
42:21.300 --> 42:23.143
Don't overthink it anymore, baby.

420
42:27.840 --> 42:29.950
Thank you so much, Jinna.

421
42:31.647 --> 42:34.016
Thank you for coming into my life.

422
42:35.060 --> 42:39.636
Thank you for everything. I love you so much.

423
42:44.640 --> 42:46.543
I love you even more.

424
43:08.960 --> 43:10.740
Hello, everyone.

425
43:10.740 --> 43:15.080
Welcome to the Engineering and Sports Science Friendship Games!

426
43:15.080 --> 43:18.429
Let's hear you cheer for your faculty!

427
43:21.206 --> 43:25.800
Before the competition, we have a special performance for you!

428
43:25.800 --> 43:29.943
Representatives from both faculties are here to cheer you on!

429
43:31.360 --> 43:36.280
Who are you cheering for? It's Art from Engineering?

430
43:36.280 --> 43:40.076
Or is it Dunk from Sports Science?

431
43:41.827 --> 43:45.923
All right, keep that energy going! Now, let's get started.

432
44:08.680 --> 44:11.363
Why are you still sitting? Get up, everyone!

433
44:19.200 --> 44:22.923
Our friends are freaking awesome. Bum looks so cool!

434
44:25.400 --> 44:31.356
♪ I used to wonder what we were ♪

435
44:31.920 --> 44:37.920
♪ I thought love needed something clearer ♪

436
44:38.613 --> 44:44.523
♪ It took me time to learn what really matters ♪

437
44:45.480 --> 44:51.280
♪ Love has no rules in relationships ♪

438
44:51.920 --> 44:57.720
♪ As long as I know what my heart wants to find ♪

439
44:57.720 --> 45:00.320
♪ As long as you're standing by my side ♪

440
45:00.320 --> 45:03.480
♪ With you, the only one I'd choose every time ♪

441
45:03.480 --> 45:07.960
♪ I don't need a reason, as long as you're mine ♪

442
45:07.960 --> 45:11.040
♪ As long as you hold my hand ♪

443
45:11.040 --> 45:13.660
♪ As long as next to me is where you stand ♪

444
45:13.660 --> 45:17.000
♪ You're the one I'll always try to understand ♪

445
45:17.000 --> 45:21.320
♪ No matter how hard the road may be ♪

446
45:21.320 --> 45:24.660
♪ Just hold my hand, and we'll be free ♪

447
45:24.660 --> 45:27.956
♪ As long as you're here with me ♪

448
45:28.680 --> 45:34.670
♪ I rest my hands, holding on to yours ♪

449
45:35.360 --> 45:41.323
♪ You chased away my uncertainty ♪

450
45:42.000 --> 45:48.280
♪ No words were said, but I hear you ♪

451
45:48.280 --> 45:54.263
♪ Loud and clear, it's meant to be ♪

452
